ficiale e gentiluomo","overview":"Zack Mayo, figlio di un marinaio, è cresciuto in giro per i porti del mondo al contatto con le più umilianti situazioni umane. Ora, per rifarsi una vita, si iscrive al corso per piloti militari di jet della marina. Si scontra con l'istruttore che lo perseguita e lo sottopone alle prove peggiori , intanto conosce Paula e se ne innamora.","tagline":"La vita non gli ha dato nulla, tranne il coraggio di vincere ... e una donna da amare."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Zack Mayo is an aloof, taciturn man who aspires to be a navy pilot. Once he arrives at training camp for his 13-week officer's course, Mayo runs afoul of abrasive, no-nonsense drill Sergeant Emil Foley. Mayo is an excellent cadet, but a little cold around the heart, so Foley rides him mercilessly, sensing that the young man would be prime officer material if he weren't so self-involved. Zack's affair with a working girl is likewise compromised by his unwillingness to give of himself.","tagline":"Life gave him nothing, except the courage to win...and a woman to love."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3gPGCeNSTBCdWvSlrM3454u2Qxg.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w1lWBgc1FWtS2EM0vksA6bZtRYw.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":2623,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3gPGCeNSTBCdWvSlrM3454u2Qxg.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3gPGCeNSTBCdWvSlrM3454u2Qxg.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3gPGCeNSTBCdWvSlrM3454u2Qxg.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3gPGCeNSTBCdWvSlrM3454u2Qxg.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ngoX